{"2835240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fear & Hope", "steam_appid": 2835240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fear and Hope</i> has a decision-based narrative gameplay engine that offers the player multiple branching story paths through the game, each with its own unique challenges, puzzles, clues, characters, monsters / enemies, weapons, survival mechanics and other discoveries to explore. Trying to solve all paths provides a good level of replayability allowing players to uncover more of the game's rich lore, world history, and mysteries with each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging mini-game <strong>3D</strong> <strong>puzzles</strong> integrated throughout the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.poster.avif?t=1781609927\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.webm?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.mp4?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and inspect <strong>clues</strong> that change depending on the choices you make</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a02c265fe9e60b21d734ad577a69d1e6.poster.avif?t=1781609927\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a02c265fe9e60b21d734ad577a69d1e6.webm?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a02c265fe9e60b21d734ad577a69d1e6.mp4?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Games of chance</strong> where fortune plays its hand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/cd6665516a1245899ec3b065744c4515.poster.avif?t=1781609927\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/cd6665516a1245899ec3b065744c4515.webm?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/cd6665516a1245899ec3b065744c4515.mp4?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intriguing <strong>character conversations, </strong>interactions and insights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/585272573785ef3c86d1a694bde6e957.poster.avif?t=1781609927\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/585272573785ef3c86d1a694bde6e957.webm?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/585272573785ef3c86d1a694bde6e957.mp4?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choice and chance based combat situations </strong>against various enemies and monsters using a variety of weapons. You may find weapons as hidden clues or obtain them through other means</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.poster.avif?t=1781609927\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.webm?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.mp4?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survivalist gameplay mechanics</strong> like needing to manage, scavenge and find scarce food and fresh water resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/054dd0319d643c850c6e06e2214d5d09.poster.avif?t=1781609927\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/054dd0319d643c850c6e06e2214d5d09.webm?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/054dd0319d643c850c6e06e2214d5d09.mp4?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹🔹🔹</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;As the same chain fastens the prisoner and the soldier who guards them, so fear and hope, dissimilar as they are, keep step together. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each belongs to a mind that is in suspense, a mind looking forward to the future. Our memory recalls the tortures of fear, while foresight anticipates them.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The present alone makes no person wretched.&quot;</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Seneca, Letter V</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹🔹🔹</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Let The Adventure Begin</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awake on a path in a strange forest with no idea how you got there or why you are there. There is nothing in your possession outside of the clothes on your back. Shaking off a thick drowsiness and as your mind clears you become determined to find an explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange, new world where things may not be quite what they seem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truths will you uncover, which paths will you follow and where will they take you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will your story be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fear and Hope</i> has a decision-based narrative gameplay engine that offers the player multiple branching story paths through the game, each with its own unique challenges, puzzles, clues, characters, monsters / enemies, weapons, survival mechanics and other discoveries to explore. Trying to solve all paths provides a good level of replayability allowing players to uncover more of the game's rich lore, world history, and mysteries with each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging mini-game <strong>3D</strong> <strong>puzzles</strong> integrated throughout the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.poster.avif?t=1781609927\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.webm?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.mp4?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and inspect <strong>clues</strong> that change depending on the choices you make</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a02c265fe9e60b21d734ad577a69d1e6.poster.avif?t=1781609927\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a02c265fe9e60b21d734ad577a69d1e6.webm?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a02c265fe9e60b21d734ad577a69d1e6.mp4?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Games of chance</strong> where fortune plays its hand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/cd6665516a1245899ec3b065744c4515.poster.avif?t=1781609927\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/cd6665516a1245899ec3b065744c4515.webm?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/cd6665516a1245899ec3b065744c4515.mp4?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intriguing <strong>character conversations, </strong>interactions and insights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/585272573785ef3c86d1a694bde6e957.poster.avif?t=1781609927\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/585272573785ef3c86d1a694bde6e957.webm?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/585272573785ef3c86d1a694bde6e957.mp4?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choice and chance based combat situations </strong>against various enemies and monsters using a variety of weapons. You may find weapons as hidden clues or obtain them through other means</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.poster.avif?t=1781609927\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.webm?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.mp4?t=1781609927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survivalist gameplay mechanics</strong> like needing to manage, scavenge and find scarce food and fresh water resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi