lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will your story be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "An immersive choose your own adventure mystery game with sci-fi and detective/crime themes. Explore a brave new world containing unique puzzles, hidden clues, intriguing characters, monsters / enemies, weapons, survivalist elements and games of chance.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/a75432200957d3d2df384f90d233e30061d877b9/header.jpg?t=1781609927", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/2e66c78566a9308a950af3d1d03eaffaf6f1248b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781609927", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/2e66c78566a9308a950af3d1d03eaffaf6f1248b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781609927", "website": "https://sites.google.com/view/fear-and-hope/home", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, Intel or both<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Copyright © 2024-2026 Imaginings Software, DUNS 745750345, ABN 87 493 926 697. All Rights Reserved.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game does not collect or store any user data. Noting that our full privacy policy can be found via the game website, the link to which is in the external links section of this store page.", "developers": ["Imaginings Software"], "publi